title Hands outside the box
intro The ball is loose outside the box.

setup
  lineup 7v7
  ball at 33.6, 21.8

step
  caption The ball is outside the penalty area.
  draw penalty-area left

step
  caption Your goalie runs out of the box to get it.
  B-G to 33.6, 21.8
  draw penalty-area left
  duration 1200

question
  prompt Can they pick it up here?
  answer No
  wrong Yes
  wrong Only outside the box
  wrong Only after a goal
  correct Feet only outside the box.
  why Outside the penalty area, the goalie cannot use their hands.

question
  prompt What should they do?
  answer Use their feet
  wrong Pick it up
  wrong Corner kick
  wrong Goal kick
  correct Use their feet.
  why Outside the box they must use their feet, like anyone else.

step
  caption The goalie has to use their feet.
  ball with B-G
  label B-G Kick
  no-hands B-G
  draw penalty-area left

step
  caption They kick it away — no hands.
  ball to 44.1, 27.2
  arrow from B-G to ball
  no-hands B-G
  draw penalty-area left
  banner No hands
  duration 1200
